Ne4 $6 { In the game Black placed the knight on the natural central square, but it turns out to be quite unstable here. } 2. Re1 Bf5 3. Nh4 $1 e6 4. Nxf5 exf5 5. Be3 $16 { White will play f2-f3 next, maintaining their central control and having the bishop pair to boot. } 
